WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.340
Projects: projects: milestones, payments, progress updates, change orders and handover.

2
00:00:08.893 --> 00:00:15.390
Under "Milestones & payments", set the stages and each amount and click "Save milestones".

3
00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:19.880
Send progress photos and text with "New progress update".

4
00:00:20.428 --> 00:00:25.720
Record extra work with "New change order" so the customer approves its price and time.

5
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:31.750
At the end, "Hand over"; the balance and a review are requested automatically.

6
00:00:32.303 --> 00:00:37.700
Don't do extra work without an approved change order; most disputes start there.
